，輶譯厭瞻巡之數，固將開桂林於鳳山，創金城於西守。而蠢爾獯狄，敢讎大邦，假息關河，竊命函谷，淪故京之爽塏，變舊邑而荒涼，息反坫之儒衣，久伊川之被髮。北地殘氓，東都遺老，莫不茹泣吞悲，傾耳戴目，翹心仁政，延首王風。若試馳咫尺之書，具甄戎旅之卒，徇其墮城，納其降虜，可弗勞弦鏃，無待干戈。真皇王之兵，征而不戰者也。臣乞以執殳先邁，式道中原，澄澣渚之恒流，掃狼山之積霧，係單于之頸，屈左賢之膝，習呼韓之舊儀，拜鑾輿之巡幸。然後天移雲動，勒封岱宗，咸五登三，追蹤七十，百神肅警，萬國具僚，璯弁星離，玉帛雲聚，集三燭於蘭席，聆萬歲之禎聲，豈不盛哉！豈不韙哉！","note":"卷內說話人、對話對象或上下文。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-wangrong-ws1492435"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin:p001","text":"虛閭權渠單于子稽侯狦既不得立","mentions":[{"id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin:p001:m0000","surface":"虛閭權渠","start":0,"end":4,"person_id":"fv1_k6x_jeu","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin:p001:m0007","surface":"稽侯狦","start":7,"end":10,"person_id":"fv1_k6x_jeu_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2605445,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":191,"last_line":191,"line_start":83,"line_end":97,"raw_start":15391,"raw_end":15405,"raw_character_offsets":[15391,15392,15393,15394,15395,15396,15397,15398,15399,15400,15401,15402,15403,15404],"projection_sha256":"30809bd46123e069dcbedf71691f63cdbb5731b88f7bb2a6d4056f290effb98d"},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin","book_id":"b-hanshu-094a","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin-ws2605445"},{"id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin:p002","text":"共立稽侯蛳為呼韓邪單于","mentions":[{"id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin:p002:m0002","surface":"稽侯蛳","start":2,"end":5,"person_id":"fv1_k6x_jeu_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin:p002:m0006","surface":"呼韓邪","start":6,"end":9,"person_id":"fv1_k6x_jeu_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2605445,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":193,"last_line":193,"line_start":167,"line_end":178,"raw_start":15734,"raw_end":15745,"raw_character_offsets":[15734,15735,15736,15737,15738,15739,15740,15741,15742,15743,15744],"projection_sha256":"759ada15c2cc56de886e1f24207e9be0c54c3a2e5572b748db38a1fc78112f9c"},"chapter_id":"c-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin","book_id":"b-hanshu-094a","work_id":"w-hanshu","source_id":"s-hanshu-094-huhanye-origin-ws2605445"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p011","text":"方今九服清怡，三靈和晏，木有附枝，輪無異轍，東鞮獻舞，南辮傳歌，羗、踰山，秦、屠越海，舌象翫委體之懃，輶譯厭瞻巡之數，固將開桂林於鳳山，創金城於西守。而蠢爾獯狄，敢讎大邦，假息關河，竊命函谷，淪故京之爽塏，變舊邑而荒涼，息反坫之儒衣，久伊川之被髮。北地殘氓，東都遺老，莫不茹泣吞悲，傾耳戴目，翹心仁政，延首王風。若試馳咫尺之書，具甄戎旅之卒，徇其墮城，納其降虜，可弗勞弦鏃，無待干戈。真皇王之兵，征而不戰者也。臣乞以執殳先邁，式道中原，澄澣渚之恒流，掃狼山之積霧，係單于之頸，屈左賢之膝，習呼韓之舊儀，拜鑾輿之巡幸。然後天移雲動，勒封岱宗，咸五登三，追蹤七十，百神肅警，萬國具僚，璯弁星離，玉帛雲聚，集三燭於蘭席，聆萬歲之禎聲，豈不盛哉！豈不韙哉！","mentions":[],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1492435,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":32,"last_line":32,"line_start":3,"line_end":327,"raw_start":2100,"raw_end":2424,"raw_character_offsets":[2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128,2129,2130,2131,2132,2133,2134,2135,2136,2137,2138,2139,2140,2141,2142,2143,2144,2145,2146,2147,2148,2149,2150,2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160,2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171,2172,2173,2174,2175,2176,2177,2178,2179,2180,2181,2182,2183,2184,2185,2186,2187,2188,2189,2190,2191,2192,2193,2194,2195,2196,2197,2198,2199,2200,2201,2202,2203,2204,2205,2206,2207,2208,2209,2210,2211,2212,2213,2214,2215,2216,2217,2218,2219,2220,2221,2222,2223,2224,2225,2226,2227,2228,2229,2230,2231,2232,2233